{
  "title": "Tutorial XCIPTV Player",
  "description": "Aprenda a configurar o XCIPTV, o player mais completo para Android, TV Box e Smart TVs.",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10'><div class='bg-blue-600/10 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-info-circle'></i> Alta Performance</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>O XCIPTV é famoso por sua interface robusta e rápida. Ele suporta o login direto via Xtream Codes, facilitando a configuração.</p></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>1</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Acesse a Tela de Login</h4><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mb-4'>Ao abrir o aplicativo, selecione a opção <b>Xtream Codes API</b> para inserir seus dados de acesso.</p><div class='rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-2xl max-w-sm bg-black/20 p-4 text-center'><i class='fas fa-user-lock text-4xl text-blue-500 mb-2'></i><p class='text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase font-black'>Login via Xtream Codes</p></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>2</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Preencha seus Dados</h4><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 rounded-3xl p-6 space-y-4 shadow-xl'><p class='text-blue-400 font-bold text-xs mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest'>Insira os dados do seu painel:</p><div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-3'><div class='p-4 bg-[#0d1117] rounded-2xl border border-gray-800'><p class='text-[8px] font-black text-gray-500 uppercase mb-1'>Server URL (Host)</p><p class='text-[10px] font-bold text-white'>Use a URL/DNS disponível no seu painel</p></div><div class='p-4 bg-[#0d1117] rounded-2xl border border-gray-800'><p class='text-[8px] font-black text-gray-500 uppercase mb-1'>Username (Usuário)</p><p class='text-[10px] font-bold text-white'>Seu usuário IPTV</p></div><div class='p-4 bg-[#0d1117] rounded-2xl border border-gray-800'><p class='text-[8px] font-black text-gray-500 uppercase mb-1'>Password (Senha)</p><p class='text-[10px] font-bold text-white'>Sua senha IPTV</p></div></div><p class='text-[9px] text-gray-500 italic mt-2'>Clique em <b>LOGIN</b> e aguarde o carregamento dos conteúdos.</p></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>3</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Vídeos de Configuração</h4><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mb-6'>Veja como personalizar e usar os recursos avançados do XCIPTV:</p><div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4'><div class='space-y-2'><p class='text-[8px] font-black text-blue-400 uppercase text-center'>Trocar Layout</p><div class='rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-lg'><video controls class='w-full'><source src='/shared_assets/videos_tutoriais/apps/trocar-layout-xciptv.mp4' type='video/mp4'></video></div></div><div class='space-y-2'><p class='text-[8px] font-black text-emerald-400 uppercase text-center'>Adicionar Favoritos</p><div class='rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-lg'><video controls class='w-full'><source src='/shared_assets/videos_tutoriais/apps/adicionar-favoritos-xciptv.mp4' type='video/mp4'></video></div></div><div class='space-y-2'><p class='text-[8px] font-black text-purple-400 uppercase text-center'>Atualizar Conteúdos</p><div class='rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-lg'><video controls class='w-full'><source src='/shared_assets/videos_tutoriais/apps/atualizar-conteudos-xciptv.mp4' type='video/mp4'></video></div></div></div></section></div>"
  }
}